Subject: BUILD.mk: compile sources added upstream between dbe9c0c and 04eb4c44

Replaces dropped patches 0005/0006: the gemma4 unified-projector backport
(a731805ced) is an ancestor of the new pin, so the sources are upstream now;
this patch only registers the files added in the 208 intervening commits
with the cosmocc build (upstream added them in CMakeLists.txt, which this
build does not use): gemma4-assistant (Gemma4 MTP drafter), deepseek32,
mellum, llama-kv-cache-dsa, imatrix-loader, and five new mtmd projector
models including gemma4ua/gemma4uv.

